{"id":"03ecb67f86ea10f0","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-clone-maximal.md","title":"Maximal Clone","display":"Maximal Clone","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-clone-maximal","aliases":["93-fact-clone-maximal"],"display":"Maximal Clone","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-clone]]","[[93-df-maximal-clone]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-clone-maximal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-clone-maximal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Maximal Clone"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" href=\"?note=ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" title=\"93-df-clone\">93-df-clone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fab5c338808585f\" href=\"?note=0fab5c338808585f\" title=\"93-df-maximal-clone\">93-df-maximal-clone</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-clone-maximal-—-Maximal-Clone\">fact-clone-maximal — Maximal Clone</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a nonempty set, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_A\">\\(\\mathcal O_A\\)</span> is the all-finitary-operations class defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fab5c338808585f\" href=\"?note=0fab5c338808585f\" title=\"93-df-maximal-clone\">93-df-maximal-clone</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\)</span> is the least clone on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fab5c338808585f\" href=\"?note=0fab5c338808585f\" title=\"93-df-maximal-clone\">93-df-maximal-clone</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\\)</span> means that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is maximal among proper clones on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}clone\\text{-}maximal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land C\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathcal O_A\\setminus C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(C\\cup\\{f\\},A)=\\mathcal O_A\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}clone\\text{-}maximal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land C\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathcal O_A\\setminus C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(C\\cup\\{f\\},A)=\\mathcal O_A\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the extension criterion for a maximal proper clone.  A term or\npolynomial clone need not be maximal; maximality requires the displayed\ncondition for every operation outside it.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-clone-maximal-—-Maximal-Clone","text":"fact-clone-maximal — Maximal Clone","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-clone","status":"resolved","id":"ee2f4c926e0e30e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-clone]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-maximal-clone","status":"resolved","id":"0fab5c338808585f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-maximal-clone]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-maximal-clone","status":"resolved","id":"0fab5c338808585f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ is a nonempty set, $\\mathcal O_A$ is the all-finitary-operations class defined in [[93-df-maximal-clone]], and $\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)$.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-maximal-clone","status":"resolved","id":"0fab5c338808585f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)$ is the least clone on $A$ containing $D$ (see [[93-df-maximal-clone]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}clone\\text{-}maximal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land C\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathcal O_A\\setminus C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(C\\cup\\{f\\},A)=\\mathcal O_A\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1152,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["ee2f4c926e0e30e6","0fab5c338808585f"]}